  "content": "<p>Soil discovery at the Kreativlabor site – a scientific report</p><p>In 2016, researchers from the Technical University of Munich identified unusually high concentrations of semiconductor metals, precious metals, and previously unknown energy sources in the ground of today&#39;s Munich Maker Lab.</p><p>A perfect habitat for a makerspace.</p><p>Take a closer look at the soil model on site and explore the distinct layers yourself.</p>",
